---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '@components/Hero.astro';
import { site, offers, cta } from '@config/site';
import { evidenceMatrixVisual, decisionBriefVisual } from '@data/v8Visuals';
---
<Base title={site.name} description={site.description} path="/">
  <Hero />

  <main class="home8">
    <section class="visual8" id="visual-proof" aria-labelledby="visual8-title">
      <div class="container-wide">
        <header class="section-head section-head--center">
          <span class="kicker">WHAT YOU ACTUALLY RECEIVE</span>
          <h2 id="visual8-title">Evidence you can inspect — not a wall of prose.</h2>
          <p>The brief keeps the claim, evidence state, source and decision use visible. These previews illustrate the format; the live sample shows the sourced Intercom × Zendesk case.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="visual8__gallery">
          <figure class="visual-card visual-card--matrix">
            <img src={evidenceMatrixVisual} alt="Illustrative Evidence Axis evidence matrix showing Fact, Inference and Unknown states" loading="eager" />
            <figcaption><span>01 / EVIDENCE MATRIX</span><b>Claim → state → source → decision use</b></figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="visual-card visual-card--brief">
            <img src={decisionBriefVisual} alt="Illustrative Evidence Axis decision brief spread" loading="lazy" />
            <figcaption><span>02 / DECISION BRIEF</span><b>What is supported, what is inferred, what remains open</b></figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="visual8__links">
          <a class="button-dark" href="/sample-report/">Open live sample report →</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/method/">See the research method</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="workflow8" aria-labelledby="workflow8-title">
      <div class="container-wide workflow8__grid">
        <div class="workflow8__copy">
          <span class="kicker kicker--light">WHY THE WORKFLOW MATTERS</span>
          <h2 id="workflow8-title">A fast summary is useful. A decision brief needs traceability.</h2>
          <p>Evidence Axis uses AI inside a controlled research workflow, then keeps source records, evidence states and unresolved questions visible. The distinction is the workflow and evidence discipline — not a claim that AI cannot perform research tasks.</p>
          <a href="/method/">Read the method →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="workflow8__steps" aria-label="Evidence Axis workflow">
          <article class="step step--cyan"><span>01</span><b>Open the source</b><p>Lawful public competitor evidence with a check date.</p></article>
          <article class="step step--amber"><span>02</span><b>Separate judgment</b><p>Fact, Inference and Unknown never silently merge.</p></article>
          <article class="step step--violet"><span>03</span><b>Trace the move</b><p>Decision implications lead backward to the evidence.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="offers8" id="services" aria-labelledby="offers8-title">
      <div class="container-wide">
        <header class="offers8__head">
          <div><span class="kicker">ENGAGEMENTS</span><h2 id="offers8-title">Choose the smallest brief that can settle the question.</h2></div>
          <p>Start with a narrow buying decision. Expand the research boundary only when the decision genuinely needs a wider evidence field.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="offers8__grid">
          <article class="offer-main">
            <div class="offer-main__ribbon">MOST COMMON START</div>
            <div class="offer-main__content">
              <span class="offer-label">FAST DECISION</span>
              <h3>{offers.twoCompetitor.name}</h3>
              <p>Two named competitors, one defined decision question, an evidence matrix, source register, explicit Unknowns and decision implications.</p>
              <div class="offer-main__stats">
                <div class="price-stat"><small>STARTING PRICE</small><strong>{offers.twoCompetitor.priceDisplay}</strong></div>
                <div class="delivery-stat"><small>DELIVERY</small><strong>{offers.twoCompetitor.delivery}</strong></div>
              </div>
              <div class="offer-chips"><span>Evidence matrix</span><span>Source register</span><span>Fact / Inference / Unknown</span></div>
              <a href="/competitor-brief/">Start with two <b>→</b></a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <div class="offers8__side">
            <article class="offer-side offer-side--blue">
              <div class="offer-side__top"><span>BROADER READ</span><strong>{offers.fiveCompetitor.priceDisplay}</strong></div>
              <h3>{offers.fiveCompetitor.name}</h3>
              <p>Five named competitors around one research question, with positioning, packaging and capability evidence surfaced together.</p>
              <footer><b>{offers.fiveCompetitor.delivery}</b><a href="/competitor-brief/">Compare five →</a></footer>
            </article>
            <article class="offer-side offer-side--violet">
              <div class="offer-side__top"><span>STRATEGIC SCOPE</span><strong>{offers.blueprint.priceDisplay}</strong></div>
              <h3>{offers.blueprint.name}</h3>
              <p>For a higher-stakes decision that needs a wider evidence base, deeper synthesis and a custom research boundary.</p>
              <footer><b>{offers.blueprint.delivery}</b><a href="/strategic-blueprint/">Scope a blueprint →</a></footer>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sample8" aria-labelledby="sample8-title">
      <div class="container-wide sample8__grid">
        <div class="sample8__frame">
          <img src={decisionBriefVisual} alt="Illustrative decision brief visual" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="sample8__badge">LIVE SAMPLE AVAILABLE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sample8__copy">
          <span class="kicker kicker--light">SEE THE STANDARD BEFORE YOU BUY</span>
          <h2 id="sample8-title">Intercom × Zendesk. Eight first-party sources. Visible evidence states.</h2>
          <p>The live sample shows the research standard, source register, Fact / Inference / Unknown separation and the limits of what public evidence can establish.</p>
          <div><a class="button-light" href="/sample-report/">View Sample Report →</a><a class="text-link text-link--light" href="/report/evidence-axis-sample-intercom-vs-zendesk.pdf">Open PDF</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="final8" aria-labelledby="final8-title">
      <div class="container final8__inner">
        <span class="kicker">START SMALL</span>
        <h2 id="final8-title">Bring the decision your team keeps debating.</h2>
        <p>Send the competitors, the question, and the context that changes what “better” means for your team.</p>
        <div><a href={cta.primary.href}>Start a Brief →</a><a href="mailto:hello@evidenceaxis.com">hello@evidenceaxis.com</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .home8{--ink:#0b1320;--muted:#5e6978;--cyan:#14b9b1;--amber:#f29a35;--violet:#7651df;--blue:#537ff0;--coral:#ef654b;background:#f7f1e8;color:var(--ink)}.kicker{font:800 .68rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5578bf}.kicker--light{color:#8fb4ff}.section-head h2,.workflow8 h2,.offers8 h2,.sample8 h2,.final8 h2{margin:.8rem 0 0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,4.25rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em}.section-head p,.offers8__head>p,.workflow8__copy>p,.sample8__copy>p,.final8 p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.7}.section-head--center{text-align:center;max-width:54rem;margin:0 auto}.section-head--center p{margin:1rem auto 0}
  .visual8{padding:clamp(5.5rem,8vw,8rem) 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbf7f0,#efe7da)}.visual8__gallery{margin-top:3rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:1.4rem;align-items:center;perspective:1500px}.visual-card{position:relative;margin:0;border-radius:1.45rem;overflow:hidden;background:#07111e;border:1px solid rgba(48,72,105,.18);box-shadow:0 34px 85px rgba(48,39,25,.17);transition:transform .28s ease,box-shadow .28s ease}.visual-card--matrix{transform:rotateY(2deg) rotateX(.5deg)}.visual-card--brief{transform:rotateY(-3deg) translateY(1.5rem)}.visual-card:hover{transform:translateY(-10px) rotateY(0);box-shadow:0 45px 100px rgba(48,39,25,.23)}.visual-card img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.7/1;object-fit:cover}.visual-card figcaption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;align-items:center;padding:1rem 1.15rem;background:#07111e;color:#dbe6f5}.visual-card figcaption span{font:800 .6rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.11em;color:#5fe0d9}.visual-card figcaption b{font-size:.82rem;text-align:right}.visual8__links{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;margin-top:3rem}.button-dark,.button-light{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:3.2rem;padding:0 1.2rem;border-radius:.72rem;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}.button-dark{background:#0b1627;color:#fff}.button-light{background:#fff;color:#081222}.text-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:#244e88;font-weight:750;text-decoration:none}.text-link--light{color:#91b9ff}
  .workflow8{padding:clamp(5.8rem,8vw,8.5rem) 0;background:#07111e;color:#eef5ff}.workflow8__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,6rem);align-items:center}.workflow8 h2{color:#fff}.workflow8__copy>p{color:#a9bad0}.workflow8__copy>a{display:inline-flex;margin-top:1.2rem;color:#65ddd8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}.workflow8__steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem}.step{--accent:var(--cyan);min-height:18rem;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:1.25rem;background:linear-gradient(155deg,rgba(26,49,78,.8),rgba(8,18,34,.95));border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 32%,transparent);box-shadow:0 26px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transform:perspective(900px) rotateX(0);transition:.25s ease}.step:hover{transform:perspective(900px) rotateX(4deg) translateY(-7px)}.step--amber{--accent:var(--amber)}.step--violet{--accent:var(--violet)}.step span{font:800 .68rem/1 var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)}.step b{display:block;margin:4.5rem 0 .7rem;font:750 1.45rem/1.05 var(--font-display);color:#fff}.step p{margin:0;color:#9fb1c9;line-height:1.65}
  .offers8{padding:clamp(5.8rem,8vw,8rem) 0;background:#f8f4ed}.offers8__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:2rem;align-items:end}.offers8__head>p{margin:0}.offers8__grid{margin-top:3rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.07fr .93fr;gap:1.2rem}.offer-main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3.5rem 1fr;min-height:34rem;border-radius:1.45rem;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#eef9fa,#eaf2ff);border:1px solid rgba(23,122,132,.2);box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(35,45,62,.12)}.offer-main__ribbon{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:.75rem;background:#0a7a83;color:#fff;writing-mode:vertical-rl;transform:rotate(180deg);font:800 .62rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em}.offer-main__content{padding:2rem}.offer-label{font:800 .7rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.13em;color:#07828a}.offer-main h3,.offer-side h3{margin:1rem 0 .45rem;font:760 2rem/1.05 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.035em}.offer-main__content>p,.offer-side>p{color:#56677a;line-height:1.65}.offer-main__stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.9rem;margin:2rem 0}.offer-main__stats>div{min-height:8.6rem;padding:1.1rem;border-radius:1rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 18px 38px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.offer-main__stats small{font:850 .65rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.1em}.offer-main__stats strong{margin-top:.5rem;font:850 clamp(2rem,3vw,3.35rem)/1 var(--font-display)}.price-stat{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffb347,#f47e35);color:#281207}.delivery-stat{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ff6d5a,#e8443c);color:#fff}.offer-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem}.offer-chips span{padding:.5rem .65rem;border-radius:99px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(52,85,119,.12);font-size:.76rem;color:#506176}.offer-main__content>a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:1.5rem;min-height:3.5rem;padding:0 1rem;border-radius:.72rem;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#13878d,#2a9fa6);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:850}.offers8__side{display:grid;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;gap:1.2rem}.offer-side{--accent:var(--blue);padding:1.6rem;border-radius:1.35rem;background:#fff;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 20%,#dce2eb);box-shadow:0 24px 58px rgba(35,45,62,.09);border-left:.38rem solid var(--accent)}.offer-side--violet{--accent:var(--violet)}.offer-side__top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;align-items:center}.offer-side__top span{font:800 .65rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--accent)}.offer-side__top strong{padding:.55rem .75rem;border-radius:.65rem;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 13%,#fff);color:var(--accent);font:850 1.55rem/1 var(--font-display)}.offer-side h3{font-size:1.7rem}.offer-side footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1.5rem;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid #e8ebef}.offer-side footer b{font-size:.85rem;color:#69788b}.offer-side footer a{color:#101b2b;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}
  .sample8{padding:clamp(5.8rem,8vw,8rem) 0;background:linear-gradient(115deg,#0a1830,#102857 60%,#172a54);color:#fff}.sample8__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem);align-items:center}.sample8__frame{position:relative;border-radius:1.25rem;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 34px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.4);transform:perspective(1400px) rotateY(4deg)}.sample8__frame img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.72/1;object-fit:cover}.sample8__badge{position:absolute;left:1rem;bottom:1rem;padding:.55rem .7rem;border-radius:.55rem;background:#52dfd8;color:#07111e;font:850 .62rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.09em}.sample8__copy h2{color:#fff}.sample8__copy>p{color:#b7c6dc}.sample8__copy>div{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.4rem}
  .final8{padding:clamp(5rem,7vw,7rem) 0;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#ef684c,#f08c46 55%,#ffb25a)}.final8__inner{text-align:center;max-width:52rem}.final8 h2{color:#17110e}.final8 p{max-width:40rem;margin:1rem auto 0;color:#4e2a20}.final8__inner>div{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.5rem}.final8__inner a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:3.25rem;padding:0 1.15rem;border-radius:.7rem;background:#111925;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:850}.final8__inner a+ a{background:transparent;color:#3a2019;border:1px solid rgba(52,28,21,.28)}
  @media(max-width:980px){.visual8__gallery,.workflow8__grid,.offers8__grid,.sample8__grid,.offers8__head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.visual-card--brief{transform:none}.workflow8__steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.offers8__side{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:auto}}
  @media(max-width:720px){.visual8,.workflow8,.offers8{padding:4.5rem 0}.visual8__gallery,.workflow8__steps,.offers8__side{grid-template-columns:1fr}.visual-card--matrix,.visual-card--brief,.sample8__frame{transform:none}.section-head h2,.workflow8 h2,.offers8 h2,.sample8 h2,.final8 h2{font-size:clamp(2.15rem,10vw,3rem)}.offer-main{grid-template-columns:2.7rem 1fr}.offer-main__content{padding:1.35rem}.offer-main__stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}.step{min-height:13rem}.step b{margin-top:2.7rem}.visual8__links{flex-direction:column;align-items:center}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.visual-card,.step{transition:none}.visual-card:hover,.step:hover{transform:none}}
</style>
